  "item": "#211 round 1 \u2014 the corridor jamb: 'reads as a hard diagonal edge, not a face; the lit wedge in the corridor above it has a straight edge that looks like the occluder's shadow mask, not a surface' (Rafe, props walk, 2026-09-13)",
